    {
      "subId": "1204006",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the marks left behind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120400601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120400601": {
            "id": "120400601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, where'd he go?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400602"
            ]
          },
          "120400602": {
            "id": "120400602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He wouldn't have gone looking for a tea set himself, would he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400603"
            ]
          },
          "120400603": {
            "id": "120400603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wouldn't put it past him...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400604"
            ]
          },
          "120400604": {
            "id": "120400604",
            "speakerId": 12076,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "Or perhaps the Ley Lines did not have the power to sustain him for very long. As was the case with the memory we saw earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400605"
            ]
          },
          "120400605": {
            "id": "120400605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... so we won't get to drink his tea?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400606"
            ]
          },
          "120400606": {
            "id": "120400606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We didn't even have a chance to say goodbye... *sobs*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400607"
            ]
          },
          "120400607": {
            "id": "120400607",
            "speakerId": 12076,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "The information held in the Ley Lines is complex and disorderly. The fact that we were able to meet him to begin with was a miracle of fate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400608"
            ]
          },
          "120400608": {
            "id": "120400608",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400611"
            ]
          },
          "120400611": {
            "id": "120400611",
            "speakerId": 12076,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "Well, this chance won't come often, and we do have a tea set. Perhaps I should try my hand at making us a pot of tea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400612"
            ]
          },
          "120400612": {
            "id": "120400612",
            "speakerId": 12076,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "I've watched Furuyama brew tea on many occasions... I doubt I should have any major problems doing it myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400613"
            ]
          },
          "120400613": {
            "id": "120400613",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Ei brews a piping-hot pot of tea with the tea set.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400614"
            ]
          },
          "120400614": {
            "id": "120400614",
            "speakerId": 12076,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "The tea is ready, please give it a try.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400615"
            ]
          },
          "120400615": {
            "id": "120400615",
            "speakerId": 12076,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "So many thoughts were racing through my head as I was brewing it, I... I'm not sure how to explain it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1204007",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the marks left behind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120400701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120400701": {
            "id": "120400701",
            "speakerId": 12377,
            "speakerName": "Furuyama",
            "text": "After my eyes went bad, many aspects of daily life became much more challenging. But I always wanted to be a competent tea brewer, right to the end.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120400702"
            ]
          },
          "120400702": {
            "id": "120400702",
            "speakerId": 12377,
            "speakerName": "Furuyama",
            "text": "*sigh* But now, it looks like I have to rely on you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1204008",
